-- An index has one kind: a second UNIQUE, COUNT, FULLTEXT, HNSW or DISKANN clause,
-- including a repeat of the first, is refused rather than replacing it. A COUNT
-- index takes no FIELDS, so the pairs that start with COUNT leave them out.
DEFINE INDEX i ON t FIELDS f UNIQUE UNIQUE;
DEFINE INDEX i ON t FIELDS f UNIQUE COUNT;
DEFINE INDEX i ON t FIELDS f UNIQUE FULLTEXT ANALYZER a BM25 HIGHLIGHTS;
DEFINE INDEX i ON t FIELDS f UNIQUE HNSW DIMENSION 2 DIST COSINE;
DEFINE INDEX i ON t FIELDS f UNIQUE DISKANN DIMENSION 2 DEGREE 8;
DEFINE INDEX i ON t COUNT UNIQUE;
DEFINE INDEX i ON t COUNT COUNT;
DEFINE INDEX i ON t COUNT FULLTEXT ANALYZER a BM25 HIGHLIGHTS;
DEFINE INDEX i ON t COUNT HNSW DIMENSION 2 DIST COSINE;
DEFINE INDEX i ON t COUNT DISKANN DIMENSION 2 DEGREE 8;
DEFINE INDEX i ON t FIELDS f FULLTEXT ANALYZER a BM25 HIGHLIGHTS UNIQUE;
DEFINE INDEX i ON t FIELDS f FULLTEXT ANALYZER a BM25 HIGHLIGHTS COUNT;
DEFINE INDEX i ON t FIELDS f FULLTEXT ANALYZER a BM25 HIGHLIGHTS FULLTEXT ANALYZER a BM25 HIGHLIGHTS;
DEFINE INDEX i ON t FIELDS f FULLTEXT ANALYZER a BM25 HIGHLIGHTS HNSW DIMENSION 2 DIST COSINE;
DEFINE INDEX i ON t FIELDS f FULLTEXT ANALYZER a BM25 HIGHLIGHTS DISKANN DIMENSION 2 DEGREE 8;
DEFINE INDEX i ON t FIELDS f HNSW DIMENSION 2 DIST COSINE UNIQUE;
DEFINE INDEX i ON t FIELDS f HNSW DIMENSION 2 DIST COSINE COUNT;
DEFINE INDEX i ON t FIELDS f HNSW DIMENSION 2 DIST COSINE FULLTEXT ANALYZER a BM25 HIGHLIGHTS;
DEFINE INDEX i ON t FIELDS f HNSW DIMENSION 2 DIST COSINE HNSW DIMENSION 2 DIST COSINE;
DEFINE INDEX i ON t FIELDS f HNSW DIMENSION 2 DIST COSINE DISKANN DIMENSION 2 DEGREE 8;
DEFINE INDEX i ON t FIELDS f DISKANN DIMENSION 2 DEGREE 8 UNIQUE;
DEFINE INDEX i ON t FIELDS f DISKANN DIMENSION 2 DEGREE 8 COUNT;
DEFINE INDEX i ON t FIELDS f DISKANN DIMENSION 2 DEGREE 8 FULLTEXT ANALYZER a BM25 HIGHLIGHTS;
DEFINE INDEX i ON t FIELDS f DISKANN DIMENSION 2 DEGREE 8 HNSW DIMENSION 2 DIST COSINE;
DEFINE INDEX i ON t FIELDS f DISKANN DIMENSION 2 DEGREE 8 DISKANN DIMENSION 2 DEGREE 8;
DEFINE INDEX i ON t COUNT WHERE v > 1 UNIQUE;
DEFINE INDEX i ON t FIELDS f UNIQUE COMMENT 'c' FULLTEXT ANALYZER a;
DEFINE INDEX i ON t UNIQUE FIELDS f HNSW DIMENSION 2;
